{"seq":3,"slug":"log-analytics-ml","title":"日志分析与异常检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/analysis-alerting/log-analytics-ml","wordCount":1494,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"日志分析与异常检测\">日志分析与异常检测</h1><p>人工规则告警能处理&quot;已知的坏&quot;——你知道数据库连接超时是问题，所以写了一条规则。但生产环境中最危险的往往是&quot;未知的坏&quot;——一种从未见过的错误模式悄然出现，或者系统行为的微妙偏移在肉眼无法察觉的时间尺度上累积。日志分析与异常检测用统计和机器学习方法处理这类人工规则难以覆盖的场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>日志分析从 L1（关键字搜索）到 L5（自动根因分析）分五个层次递进。模式聚类（Drain 算法）将数亿条日志压缩为数百个模板，模板频率变化成为异常检测的输入信号。时间序列异常检测用统计方法（Z-Score）或 ML 方法（Isolation Forest、Prophet）处理人工规则难以覆盖的未知故障模式。LLM 辅助分析（如 ClickHouse AI Notebooks）在 2026 年成为新趋势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"日志分析的层次模型\">日志分析的层次模型</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph BT&#10;    L1[Level 1: 关键字搜索] --&gt;|&quot;grep timeout&quot;| VALUE[排障价值]&#10;    L2[Level 2: 统计聚合] --&gt;|&quot;每分钟 ERROR 数趋势&quot;| VALUE&#10;    L3[Level 3: 模式发现] --&gt;|&quot;自动聚类相似日志&quot;| VALUE&#10;    L4[Level 4: 异常检测] --&gt;|&quot;检测偏离基线的异常模式&quot;| VALUE&#10;    L5[Level 5: 根因分析] --&gt;|&quot;自动关联多信号定位根因&quot;| VALUE\">graph BT\n    L1[Level 1: 关键字搜索] --&gt;|\"grep timeout\"| VALUE[排障价值]\n    L2[Level 2: 统计聚合] --&gt;|\"每分钟 ERROR 数趋势\"| VALUE\n    L3[Level 3: 模式发现] --&gt;|\"自动聚类相似日志\"| VALUE\n    L4[Level 4: 异常检测] --&gt;|\"检测偏离基线的异常模式\"| VALUE\n    L5[Level 5: 根因分析] --&gt;|\"自动关联多信号定位根因\"| VALUE</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"center\">层次</th>\n<th>技术手段</th>\n<th align=\"center\">人工介入程度</th>\n<th>典型工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\">L1</td>\n<td>全文搜索/过滤</td>\n<td align=\"center\">高（手动查询）</td>\n<td>Kibana、Grafana Explore</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">L2</td>\n<td>聚合/可视化</td>\n<td align=\"center\">中（看图判断）</td>\n<td>Grafana Dashboard、ClickHouse SQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">L3</td>\n<td>日志聚类/模式提取</td>\n<td align=\"center\">低（审阅结果）</td>\n<td>Loki Pattern、Drain3 算法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">L4</td>\n<td>时间序列异常检测</td>\n<td align=\"center\">低（只看告警）</td>\n<td>Prophet、IsolationForest、Z-score</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">L5</td>\n<td>因果推断/关联挖掘</td>\n<td align=\"center\">极低（自动根因）</td>\n<td>ClickHouse AI Notebooks、LLM 辅助</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"日志模式聚类-log-pattern-mining\">日志模式聚类（Log Pattern Mining）</h2><h3 id=\"问题定义\">问题定义</h3><p>一个微服务每天产生数亿条日志，其中绝大多数是同一&quot;模板&quot;的不同实例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"2026-07-18T10:15:30Z INFO Request completed: user=alice, latency=45ms&#10;2026-07-18T10:15:31Z INFO Request completed: user=bob, latency=52ms&#10;2026-07-18T10:15:32Z INFO Request completed: user=charlie, latency=38ms\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>2026-07-18T10:15:30Z INFO Request completed: user=alice, latency=45ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2026-07-18T10:15:31Z INFO Request completed: user=bob, latency=52ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2026-07-18T10:15:32Z INFO Request completed: user=charlie, latency=38ms</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这三条日志本质上是同一个模式 <code>Request completed: user=&lt;*&gt;, latency=&lt;*&gt;ms</code> 的三个实例。模式聚类的目标是自动发现这些模板，将数亿条日志压缩为数百个模式——每个模式的出现频率变化就是异常检测的输入信号。</p>\n<h3 id=\"drain-算法\">Drain 算法</h3><p>Drain 是日志模式挖掘的事实标准算法，其核心是一棵前缀树（Fixed Depth Tree）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>按日志长度（token 数）分组</li>\n<li>按前几个 token 构建前缀树</li>\n<li>叶节点是一组&quot;日志集群&quot;，每个集群对应一个模式模板</li>\n<li>新日志到来时，沿前缀树查找最匹配的集群；匹配度低于阈值则创建新集群</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Similarity</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><msubsup><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Similarity}(log, cluster) = \\frac{|\\{i : token_i^{log} = token_i^{template}\\}|}{|tokens|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Similarity</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.58em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>Loki 3.x 的 Pattern Ingester</strong> 在 ingestion 时实时运行类 Drain 聚类，使得 <code>{} | pattern</code> 查询可以直接返回日志模式分布——无需离线批处理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式变化检测\">模式变化检测</h3><p>当一个新模式首次出现，或某个模式的频率发生突变时，这通常是故障的信号：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- ClickHouse: 检测新出现的日志模式（过去 1h 有但前 24h 从未出现）&#10;SELECT pattern, count() AS cnt&#10;FROM log_patterns&#10;WHERE timestamp &gt; now() - INTERVAL 1 HOUR&#10;  AND pattern NOT IN (&#10;    SELECT DISTINCT pattern&#10;    FROM log_patterns&#10;    WHERE timestamp BETWEEN now() - INTERVAL 25 HOUR AND now() - INTERVAL 1 HOUR&#10;  )&#10;ORDER BY cnt DESC&#10;LIMIT 20;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ClickHouse: 检测新出现的日志模式（过去 1h 有但前 24h 从未出现）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pattern, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cnt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> log_patterns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> HOUR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pattern </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pattern</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> log_patterns</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> HOUR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> HOUR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cnt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"时间序列异常检测\">时间序列异常检测</h2><p>将日志指标（ERROR rate、特定模式频率、日志量）转化为时间序列后，可以应用标准的异常检测算法：</p>\n<h3 id=\"统计方法\">统计方法</h3><p><strong>Z-Score 检测</strong>：假设指标服从正态分布，偏离均值超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个标准差视为异常：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mi>σ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = \\frac{x - \\mu}{\\sigma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 基于历史基线窗口计算（通常取同一天中相同时段的过去 4 周数据以消除周期性）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|z| &gt; 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 时触发告警。</p>\n<p><strong>优势</strong>：简单、可解释、计算成本低\n<strong>劣势</strong>：假设正态分布，对非对称分布（如延迟分布）效果差</p>\n<h3 id=\"基于移动窗口的检测\">基于移动窗口的检测</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    TS[时间序列数据] --&gt; BL[计算基线窗口统计]&#10;    BL --&gt; UB[上界 = μ + k·σ]&#10;    BL --&gt; LB[下界 = μ - k·σ]&#10;    TS --&gt; CMP{当前值 vs 边界}&#10;    UB --&gt; CMP&#10;    LB --&gt; CMP&#10;    CMP --&gt;|超出| ALERT[触发异常告警]&#10;    CMP --&gt;|在内| NORMAL[正常]\">graph LR\n    TS[时间序列数据] --&gt; BL[计算基线窗口统计]\n    BL --&gt; UB[上界 = μ + k·σ]\n    BL --&gt; LB[下界 = μ - k·σ]\n    TS --&gt; CMP{当前值 vs 边界}\n    UB --&gt; CMP\n    LB --&gt; CMP\n    CMP --&gt;|超出| ALERT[触发异常告警]\n    CMP --&gt;|在内| NORMAL[正常]</pre><h3 id=\"机器学习方法\">机器学习方法</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>训练需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Isolation Forest</td>\n<td>随机切分，异常点更容易被隔离</td>\n<td>多维度日志特征异常</td>\n<td>无监督</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prophet</td>\n<td>时间序列分解（趋势+季节性+残差）</td>\n<td>带周期性的日志量异常</td>\n<td>历史数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DBSCAN</td>\n<td>密度聚类，低密度区域为异常</td>\n<td>日志向量空间中的离群点</td>\n<td>无监督</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Autoencoder</td>\n<td>重构误差大的为异常</td>\n<td>高维日志特征组合异常</td>\n<td>正常数据训练</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"llm-辅助日志分析-2025-2026-新趋势\">LLM 辅助日志分析（2025-2026 新趋势）</h2><p>ClickHouse 在 2026 年推出的 AI Notebooks 代表了日志分析的新方向——用 LLM 作为分析的&quot;协飞员&quot;而非替代者：</p>\n<p>工作流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>工程师描述问题：<code>&quot;最近 30 分钟支付成功率下降&quot;</code></li>\n<li>LLM 生成候选查询（SQL/LogQL）</li>\n<li>执行查询，LLM 解读结果</li>\n<li>基于结果生成下一步探索方向</li>\n<li>工程师在任何环节可以手动修改查询或分析逻辑</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关键设计原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>透明性</strong>：每个查询、推理步骤都可见可编辑</li>\n<li><strong>非线性探索</strong>：支持从任何节点分支出新的调查方向</li>\n<li><strong>人类最终决策</strong>：LLM 提供假设和方向，不自动执行修复动作</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"根因分析的关联方法\">根因分析的关联方法</h2><p>当异常被检测到后，下一步是定位根因。日志视角的根因分析通常通过时间相关性实现：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RootCause</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>Correlation</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RootCause} = \\arg\\max_{event} \\text{Correlation}(event, anomaly, \\Delta t_{lag})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RootCause</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.45em;vertical-align:-0.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Correlation</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>实践方法</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>时间窗口关联</strong>：在异常发生前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 时间窗口内，查找首次出现的 ERROR/WARN 日志</li>\n<li><strong>服务拓扑关联</strong>：沿调用链上游追溯——如果 API Gateway 报超时，检查它依赖的 Service B 和 Database</li>\n<li><strong>变更关联</strong>：对比异常时间点与最近的部署/配置变更时间</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- ClickHouse: 查找异常前 5 分钟内首次出现的 ERROR 模式&#10;SELECT&#10;    service_name,&#10;    min(timestamp) AS first_seen,&#10;    count() AS occurrences,&#10;    any(body) AS sample&#10;FROM logs&#10;WHERE timestamp BETWEEN &#39;2026-07-18T10:10:00Z&#39; AND &#39;2026-07-18T10:15:00Z&#39;&#10;  AND severity_number &gt;= 17&#10;GROUP BY service_name&#10;ORDER BY first_seen ASC&#10;LIMIT 10;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ClickHouse: 查找异常前 5 分钟内首次出现的 ERROR 模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    service_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first_seen,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> occurrences,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    any(body) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> sample</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-07-18T10:10:00Z'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-07-18T10:15:00Z'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> severity_number </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> service_name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first_seen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>从异常检测到告警触发的完整闭环，需要与<a href=\"log-based-alerting\">基于日志的告警</a>中的告警规则框架配合——异常检测产出的信号可以作为动态阈值输入到告警规则中，替代静态的人工阈值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>日志分析与异常检测将日志系统从被动排障工具升级为主动发现引擎。Drain 模式聚类 + 频率变化检测是最实用的组合——投入产出比远优于端到端 ML 方案。Z-Score 统计检测覆盖 80% 的异常场景，Isolation Forest 处理多维度组合异常。LLM 辅助分析的关键设计原则是透明性和人类最终决策——AI 提供假设和方向，不自动执行修复。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"日志分析与异常检测","id":"日志分析与异常检测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"日志分析的层次模型","id":"日志分析的层次模型"},{"level":2,"text":"日志模式聚类（Log Pattern Mining）","id":"日志模式聚类-log-pattern-mining"},{"level":3,"text":"问题定义","id":"问题定义"},{"level":3,"text":"Drain 算法","id":"drain-算法"},{"level":3,"text":"模式变化检测","id":"模式变化检测"},{"level":2,"text":"时间序列异常检测","id":"时间序列异常检测"},{"level":3,"text":"统计方法","id":"统计方法"},{"level":3,"text":"基于移动窗口的检测","id":"基于移动窗口的检测"},{"level":3,"text":"机器学习方法","id":"机器学习方法"},{"level":2,"text":"LLM 辅助日志分析（2025-2026 新趋势）","id":"llm-辅助日志分析-2025-2026-新趋势"},{"level":2,"text":"根因分析的关联方法","id":"根因分析的关联方法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基于日志的告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/analysis-alerting/log-based-alerting"},"next":{"title":"留存与生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/log-engineering/operations/retention-lifecycle"}}